<h3><u>Maa or Ali Akbar ki Maa</u></h3>
                <div style="width:100%">
                                <p><p><span  248, 243); color:rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family:verdana,arial,geneva,helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12px">Jab Ali Akbar Sa Beta, Shah Ku Rab Nai Diya</span><br />
<span  248, 243); color:rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family:verdana,arial,geneva,helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12px">Is Aatay-e-Kibriya Par Karbala Nai Di Sada</span><br />
<span  248, 243); color:rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family:verdana,arial,geneva,helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12px">Maa Aur Ali Akbar Ki Maa X 3</span><br />
<br />
<span  248, 243); color:rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family:verdana,arial,geneva,helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12px">Us Ka Matha Chumti Thi Umm-e-Laila Baar Baar</span><br />
<span  248, 243); color:rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family:verdana,arial,geneva,helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12px">Us Ka Chehra Dekh Kar Kehti Thi Ay Parwardigar</span><br />
<span  248, 243); color:rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family:verdana,arial,geneva,helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12px">Yeah Bahar-e-Zindagi Hai, Yeah Mere Ghar Ki Bahar</span><br />
<span  248, 243); color:rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family:verdana,arial,geneva,helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12px">Yeah Meri Pehli Tamanna, Yeah Mere Dil Ka Qarar</span><br />
<span  248, 243); color:rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family:verdana,arial,geneva,helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12px">Maa Aur Ali Akbar Ki Maa X 2</span><br />
<br />
<span  248, 243); color:rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family:verdana,arial,geneva,helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12px">Kaali Dori Bandhti Nanhe Kaalaaie Main Kabhi</span><br />
<span  248, 243); color:rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family:verdana,arial,geneva,helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12px">Nanhe Sine Par Kabhi Karti Thi Dam Nad-e-Ali</span><br />
<span  248, 243); color:rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family:verdana,arial,geneva,helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12px">Kehti Thi Murjaa-e-Na Maula Mere Dil Ki Kali</span><br />
<span  248, 243); color:rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family:verdana,arial,geneva,helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12px">Ye Dil-e-Shabbir Hai Yeah Hai Hamari Zindagi</span><br />
<span  248, 243); color:rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family:verdana,arial,geneva,helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12px">Maa Aur Ali Akbar Ki Maa X 2</span><br />
<br />
<span  248, 243); color:rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family:verdana,arial,geneva,helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12px">Ghutniyoon Chal Nai Laga Jis Waqt Unka Sheer Khwar</span><br />
<span  248, 243); color:rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family:verdana,arial,geneva,helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12px">Saaf Karti Apne Aanchal Sai Oh Uski Reh Guzaar</span><br />
<span  248, 243); color:rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family:verdana,arial,geneva,helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12px">Ay Khuda Na Khasta Chub Jaye Na Bache Kai Khaar</span><br />
<span  248, 243); color:rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family:verdana,arial,geneva,helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12px">Chalte Chalte Jab Oh Thakta Pusht Pai Karti Sawar</span><br />
<span  248, 243); color:rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family:verdana,arial,geneva,helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12px">Maa Aur Ali Akbar Ki Maa X 2</span><br />
<br />
<span  248, 243); color:rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family:verdana,arial,geneva,helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12px">Sab Futun-e-Harb Sikhlate They Abbas-e-Jari</span><br />
<span  248, 243); color:rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family:verdana,arial,geneva,helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12px">Sahen Main Kursi Becha Kar Maa Bhi Aksar Dekhti</span><br />
<span  248, 243); color:rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family:verdana,arial,geneva,helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12px">Mashq Kai Douraan Eik Din Youn Hi Neze Ki Ani</span><br />
<span  248, 243); color:rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family:verdana,arial,geneva,helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12px">Chu Gaie Sine Sai Layla Par Ghashi Tari Huwi</span><br />
<span  248, 243); color:rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family:verdana,arial,geneva,helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12px">Maa Aur Ali Akbar Ki Maa X 2</span><br />
<br />
<span  248, 243); color:rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family:verdana,arial,geneva,helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12px">Eik Oh Din Tha Kai Jab Barchi Zara Si Chu Gayi</span><br />
<span  248, 243); color:rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family:verdana,arial,geneva,helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12px">Umm-e-Laila Kamp Uthi Aur Ghashi Tari Huwi</span><br />
<span  248, 243); color:rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family:verdana,arial,geneva,helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12px">Eik Ye Din Hai Maidan-e-Karbala Dekhe Koie</span><br />
<span  248, 243); color:rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family:verdana,arial,geneva,helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12px">Hai Jigar Kai Paar Neza Aur Maa Hai Dekhti</span><br />
<span  248, 243); color:rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family:verdana,arial,geneva,helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12px">Maa Aur Ali Akbar Ki Maa X 2</span><br />
<br />
<span  248, 243); color:rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family:verdana,arial,geneva,helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12px">Kya Khabar Thi Umm-e-Laila Ku Oh Din Bhi Aaega</span><br />
<span  248, 243); color:rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family:verdana,arial,geneva,helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12px">Byaah Ka Arman Dil Ka Dil Main Hi Reh Jaaega</span><br />
<span  248, 243); color:rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family:verdana,arial,geneva,helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12px">Laash Qasim Ki Tarha Tukroon Main Dil Bat Jayega</span><br />
<span  248, 243); color:rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family:verdana,arial,geneva,helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12px">Naujawan Ki Laash Par Sehra Sajaya Jaaega</span><br />
<span  248, 243); color:rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family:verdana,arial,geneva,helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12px">Maa Aur Ali Akbar Ki Maa X 2</span><br />
<br />
<span  248, 243); color:rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family:verdana,arial,geneva,helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12px">Umm-e-Laila Dil Sambhalo Arsh Sai Aayi Sada</span><br />
<span  248, 243); color:rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family:verdana,arial,geneva,helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12px">Barchiyoon Ki Simt Jata Hai Tumhara Mehlaqa</span><br />
<span  248, 243); color:rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family:verdana,arial,geneva,helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12px">Youn Karo Ruksat Kai Jaisay Ho Sama Baraat Ka</span><br />
<span  248, 243); color:rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family:verdana,arial,geneva,helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12px">Khaq Main Mil Jaaegi Laila Shabh-e-Mustafa</span><br />
<span  248, 243); color:rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family:verdana,arial,geneva,helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12px">Maa Aur Ali Akbar Ki Maa X 2</span><br />
<br />
<span  248, 243); color:rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family:verdana,arial,geneva,helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12px">Kis Tarah Raihan Ho Us Guftugu Ka Ab Bayaan</span><br />
<span  248, 243); color:rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family:verdana,arial,geneva,helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12px">Auratain Jab Sham Ki Kehti Theen Lekar Hichkiyaan</span><br />
<span  248, 243); color:rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family:verdana,arial,geneva,helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12px">Jis Jawaan Ka Nouk-e-Neza Par Huwa Hai Sar Aayan</span><br />
<span  248, 243); color:rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family:verdana,arial,geneva,helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12px">Us Jawaan Sai Pehle Ya Rab Margayi Ho Uski Maa</span><br />
<span  248, 243); color:rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family:verdana,arial,geneva,helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12px">Maa Aur Ali Akbar Ki Maa X 2</span><br />
&nbsp;</p>
